{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASTROBOTANICA\u2122 is a science-driven survival game set on prehistoric Earth. </strong>You're Xel, a highly educated alien botanist on a mission to discover rare seeds needed to save your home planet. After crashing on ancient Earth, you\u2019ll find yourself surrounded by wild animals, primal humans, and a toxic atmosphere, and you\u2019ll need to adapt quickly to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/493ef0eff4096715da60b31716cefe54.webp?t=1772520204\" width=610 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your knowledge of alien botany is the key to survival. You\u2019ll learn how to grow and process Earth\u2019s unfamiliar flora into food and medicine. Experimentation, adaptation and research will be key to finding plant species which could thrive on your home planet. But for now, you have to discover and cultivate essential herbage to secure the stable supply of carbon dioxide you need to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/5ef3307e61680b652434a6f5be55ef4b.poster.avif?t=1772520204\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/5ef3307e61680b652434a6f5be55ef4b.webm?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/5ef3307e61680b652434a6f5be55ef4b.mp4?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/16dd6785bd18b2b5a181877b65ca6058.webp?t=1772520204\" width=610 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neanderthals are curious, but timid. Learn to communicate, earn their trust, and cure their ailments using hand-crafted tonics made from plants. Heal their wounds and illnesses, and they might just reward you with tools, supplies and a helping hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/6712d0f4d193bd5daea9830cfaac8e6b.poster.avif?t=1772520204\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/6712d0f4d193bd5daea9830cfaac8e6b.webm?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/6712d0f4d193bd5daea9830cfaac8e6b.mp4?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/ea4ef9c38ca5e484b042525ae56aeffa.webp?t=1772520204\" width=610 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build walls, floors, and fences to protect your property and crops from natural disasters and hungry wildlife. Collect and manage resources to expand your shelter, turning it from a fragile dwelling into a fully-fledged abode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/bcfeb326b941b358a511b73a88396e02.poster.avif?t=1772520204\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/bcfeb326b941b358a511b73a88396e02.webm?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/bcfeb326b941b358a511b73a88396e02.mp4?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/d14b53d50a93d07bc51739061a88a9ba.webp?t=1772520204\" width=610 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through beautifully untamed wilderness, filled with secrets to uncover and a wide variety of plants to study. Observation is key - there\u2019s always something new to discover if you look closely. But stay alert! The local fauna is as cute as they are dangerous, while invariably hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/fd28c26523048d5149ac150101d00743.poster.avif?t=1772520204\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/fd28c26523048d5149ac150101d00743.webm?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/fd28c26523048d5149ac150101d00743.mp4?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/cc18955483fde06979f94e17ddb70013.webp?t=1772520204\" width=610 height=40 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle through six unique skill paths: Planetary Knowledge, Research, Investigation, Management, Adaptation, and Learning. Assigning Knowledge Points according to your habits, talents and preferences will define your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/b670ac232ba21f4cb990ab421b69bf5f.poster.avif?t=1772520204\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/b670ac232ba21f4cb990ab421b69bf5f.webm?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/b670ac232ba21f4cb990ab421b69bf5f.mp4?t=1772520204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/9d93034b7aa7f1cb6b4dfb304f44d9ce.webp?t=1772520204\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with plants to create needed resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain and maintain a sustainable CO\u2082 supply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore prehistoric ecosystems and discover extinct animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances with Neanderthals through communication and trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up using the P.R.I.M.A.L. skill system to shape your playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720920/extras/849dd8313fc6e29e628d65219e2cc884.avif?t=1772520204\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Systems Online","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2720920/ae6fc2d9d54da57f54297002239a693c5027a805.jpg"},{"name":"Say Hello, Earth!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta